ckground-lifetime and cli-fallback-cost-disclosure; this consistency assessment does not duplicate them.","The newer SPEC intentionally expands the July design's transient-only progress into recoverable observation and replaces its deprecated IDE-fork boundary with current VS Code delivery. Preserve compatible existing frames while documenting those supersessions in downstream designs.","Maintain a source-story crosswalk when retiring the July tracker entries. The current successor EPIC records tracker binding insors-ai/insrc#146.","No authored diagrams, UX definitions or generated companions are attached. DEF-stage prose adequately expresses the assessed ownership and behavior; no visual rendering verification is claimed. Downstream designs should make identity mappings, retention release, reconnect behavior and concurrent task presentation explicit."]}],"progress":{"status":"incomplete","phase":"complete","completedChunks":6,"totalChunks":6,"lastMeaningfulActivityAt":null,"activeToolCount":0,"requiresUserInput":false,"checkpointPath":"/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/consolidated-chat-progress-def.json","sequence":0,"reviewElapsedMs":0,"unitElapsedMs":null,"observedAt":"2026-11-09T06:11:53.443Z","freshness":"stored"},"startedAt":"2026-11-09T06:00:54.323Z","reviewer":"daemon","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","unit":{"unitId":"consistency","phase":"chunk_review","executionId":"957e5349-d379-441a-8274-d2b64e6adc74","dispatches":1,"retriesUsed":0,"userDirectedDispatches":0,"diagnostics":[]},"plan":{"chunks":[{"id":"scope","title":"Epic scope, requirements and consolidation traceability","selectors":["/body/title","/body/flavor","/body/summary","/body/problem","/body/nonGoals","/body/openQuestions","/body/functionalDefinition","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/0","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/1","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/2","document:line:25","/body/constraints","/body/constraints/0","/body/constraints/7","/body/